      rank(a v b)+rank(a ^ b)=rank(a)+rank(b): 0 failures  HOLDS
      cylinder factorises over the transfer: factor_q = 0  HOLDS
  caps (4, 4, 2, 6, 2)  n=19,109
      E(L) = 0                       HOLDS
      |J| = 33   sum(|A_i|-1) = 33   HOLDS
      join/meet closed: 0 leaks, BUDGET 200,000 random pairs (seed 122) of 182,567,386  HOLDS
      rank(a v b)+rank(a ^ b)=rank(a)+rank(b): 0 failures  HOLDS
