6.  32.4.1 L9093-L9098 -- chi is a product of seven Heaviside steps, and has no negation
================================================================================================
  ambient box 6,912 cells; L8_at((3,3,1,3,1)) has 976
  the seven inter-coordinate factors + the five caps cut the box to 976  EXACT against the lattice
  factors printed: seven.  Factors measured in the construction: 7  EXACT
      l <= n - 1     binding: relaxing it admits   308 further cells   BINDING
      k <= 4l + 2    binding: relaxing it admits   564 further cells   BINDING
      q <= k         binding: relaxing it admits   575 further cells   BINDING
      f <= e - 1     binding: relaxing it admits   200 further cells   BINDING
      g <= 4f + 2    binding: relaxing it admits    24 further cells   BINDING
      g <= q         binding: relaxing it admits   673 further cells   BINDING
      2S <= k        binding: relaxing it admits   300 further cells   BINDING
  every factor is an upper bound of one coordinate by a monotone function of another:
    available max, min, <=  -- no factor uses complement, negation or implication.  The
    sentence at L9093-L9098 is EXACT on the construction as tower-2.py builds it.

